From 166167c36a1679ee7a929fc94ab73749bd746bfd Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 27 Nov 2026 16:09:56 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] W10.2: CI runs make test on Node 22 and 24, the page test
 included

station-view's CI ran the comment gate alone. A test workflow now runs
make test on Node 22 and 24: install, build, every test, the comment
gate, and the stale dist/ check. Playwright and Chromium are installed
outside the package, on NODE_PATH, so the page test runs rather than
skips, and no manifest names Playwright.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_0167vhgRnddZXZJm3gcM7pwk
---
 .github/workflows/test.yml | 30 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 30 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 .github/workflows/test.yml

diff --git a/.github/workflows/test.yml b/.github/workflows/test.yml
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..d9da2ec
--- /dev/null
+++ b/.github/workflows/test.yml
@@ -0,0 +1,30 @@
+name: test
+on: [push, pull_request]
+permissions:
+  contents: read
+jobs:
+  test:
+    name: make test, Node ${{ matrix.node }}
+    runs-on: ubuntu-latest
+    strategy:
+      fail-fast: false
+      matrix:
+        node: ['22', '24']
+    steps:
+      - uses: actions/checkout@11d5960a326750d5838078e36cf38b85af677262 # v4
+        with:
+          persist-credentials: false
+      - uses: actions/setup-node@49933ea5288caeca8642d1e84afbd3f7d6820020 # v4
+        with:
+          node-version: ${{ matrix.node }}
+      # The page test drives Chromium where Playwright resolves, and skips
+      # where it does not. It is installed outside the package, so no
+      # manifest names it.
+      - name: Playwright and Chromium, outside the package
+        run: |
+          npm install --no-audit --no-fund --loglevel=error --prefix "$RUNNER_TEMP/pw" playwright@1.63.0
+          "$RUNNER_TEMP/pw/node_modules/.bin/playwright" install --with-deps chromium
+      - name: make test
+        run: make test
+        env:
+          NODE_PATH: ${{ runner.temp }}/pw/node_modules
-- 
